  "description": "White, with one long blue swoosh that rises from the belly behind the nose gear across the forward body, thinning to a point on the crown over the wing: navy along its lower, forward part, bright blue along its upper edge, with a thin silver line under its aft part. White fin with two slanting blue bands, one near the tip and one at the root, each over a thin silver line (a tallit's stripes), and a blue Star of David between them. 'EL AL' and 'אל על' as one navy wordmark over the forward windows. White engines.",
